config VIDEO_MESON_AMVDEC
	tristate "Amlogic video decoder driver"
	depends on V4L_MEM2MEM_DRIVERS
	depends on VIDEO_DEV && HAS_DMA
	select MEDIA_CONTROLLER
	depends on ARCH_MESON || COMPILE_TEST
	select VIDEOBUF2_DMA_CONTIG
	select V4L2_MEM2MEM_DEV
	select V4L2_H264
	select MESON_CANVAS
	help
	Support for the video decoder found in the Amlogic GXBB, GXL, GXM,
	G12A, G12B and SM1 SoCs: stateless H.264, HEVC, MPEG-2 and VP9
	decoding through the V4L2 request API.

	To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module will
	be called meson-amvdec.
